+/* LOCAL DIVERGENCE (mklab). TODO 18.
+ *
+ * PLACE THE FORTH ARENA AND THE DICTIONARY BELOW 4 GiB.
+ *
+ * 1275 encodes an integer into FOUR bytes (5.3.5.1), and /chosen's `stdin` and
+ * `stdout` are ihandles -- pointers into these two allocations
